  "html": "<p>In many of the <a href=\"/wiki/Crypt_Layout\" title=\"Crypt Layout\">Crypt Layout</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Torture_Chamber_Layout\" title=\"Torture Chamber Layout\">Torture Chamber Layout</a> levels, you will find sarcophagi around the walls.  They come in various shapes.  Opening them will sometimes release some loot.  They are not as generous as <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Chests\" title=\"Treasure Chests\">Treasure Chests</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Sarcophagus.jpg\" title=\"Sarcophagus\"><img alt=\"Sarcophagus\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"282\" src=\"/images/Sarcophagus.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Sarcophagus.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Sarcophagus</div></div></div>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
